      "en": "This is the history of the generations of the heavens and of the earth when they were created, in the day that the LORD God made the earth and the heavens.",
      "ko": "여호와 하나님이 천지를 창조하신 때에 천지의 창조된 대략이 이러하니라",
      "source_text_hash": "15f2656804d160f6019ff9a7b16a535e9f3ac4535fd4c923a5bf16c0f5f6fd27",
      "translation_text_hash": "bdc31cdf957e61a7815fb08937a5893c19592f97642e486875df49eceac695ae",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
