        {
          "book": "GEN",
          "chapter": 2,
          "verse": 7
        }
      ],
      "en": "The LORD God formed man from the dust of the ground, and breathed into his nostrils the breath of life; and man became a living soul.",
      "ko": "여호와 하나님이 흙으로 사람을 지으시고 생기를 그 코에 불어 넣으시니 사람이 생령이 된지라",
      "source_text_hash": "0e36a52d337d92bf3b417b341fe91bac7721017098ed2baabf826bc24790f3f3",
      "translation_text_hash": "c42eb18d74f80dfcda13a068ffeba340e8781ed528e29bb9eddb09137cdee6fe",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
