      "en": "A river went out of Eden to water the garden; and from there it was parted, and became the source of four rivers.",
      "ko": "강이 에덴에서 발원하여 동산을 적시고 거기서부터 갈라져 네 근원이 되었으니",
      "source_text_hash": "506d9075bf02332732eda1b328e5798549051a7af14d88b40ea156b2ff517ad5",
      "translation_text_hash": "ca1b0840acd0b2c2e1eba9d8d9ecab4b2783b906c838fbd68cbc34aa45df7bfe",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
