      "en": "The name of the first is Pishon: it flows through the whole land of Havilah, where there is gold;",
      "ko": "첫째의 이름은 비손이라 금이 있는 하윌라 온 땅에 둘렸으며",
      "source_text_hash": "bd4270f38cd9d2a8673afb85371e968aeb36f364b1a3ca8825120dea5499f44f",
      "translation_text_hash": "c99aa7c4d5e0e73d1a7523ff3257f0aeee20953b5e76b504d85a0284378c4281",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
